<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Nov 12.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Nov 12.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 percent protein to East Anglia Nov 115.00/115.50</p>
<p>London Jan/Mar 119.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Avon Jan/Mar 102.00</p>
<p>East Devon Nov 97.00 Dec 97.50 Jan 101.00 Jan/Mar 102.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 99.00/98.50 Dec 99.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Nov 10.00 Jan/Mar 102.00 Apr/Jun 104.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Jan/Mar 102.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Dec 100.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Nov 100.00</p>
<p>East Devon Dec 96.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 99.50/100.00</p>
<p>Norfolk Dec 98.00</p>
</text>
